<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Australia private sector credit up 0.4 pct.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Australia private sector credit up 0.4 pct.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-01-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Reserve Bank of Australia (RBA) said private sector credit extended by financial intermediaries rose by 0.4 percent in November from October, seasonally-adjusted. Credit rose 0.7 percent in October.</p>
<p>For the year to November, credit rose by 10.6 percent compared with a year-over-year rise of 11.3 percent in October.</p>
